QA3 M3, the "don't know" outcome. errors.Unwrap of a value whose dynamic type
errtrace does not know (a package-level error variable that is assigned at run
time): each Candidate's field load is one Unresolved entry. The field
locations are not expanded: neither io.EOF nor os.ErrClosed, which other
values of those types hold, is listed.
